    overview_html: `<p><strong>Epic Seven</strong> is a fantasy turn-based RPG developed by Smilegate featuring animated character recruitment. Heroes are summoned using Mystic Medals (premium currency, ~$0.99 per pull) with a 30-pull hard pity guarantee on feature banners. The game features multiple banner types: limited character banners (2-week windows), permanent pool, and published rerun schedules allowing advance planning.</p><p>Epic Seven is notable for strong free currency distribution (~2500 Mystic Medals monthly, ~25 pulls) and transparent monetization. Limited characters rotate with explicit schedules published quarterly, eliminating surprise FOMO. The game features PvP ranking modes where power creep is managed—new heroes receive soft advantages but older heroes remain competitive with optimization. The artwork and story depth differentiate it from competitors.</p>`,
